//! Peripheral tokens are generated by locked `embassy-hal-internal` macros: `init`
//! takes every token once; unsafe `steal` requires exclusive use of each peripheral.
//! Interrupt types configure the current core NVIC; enabling requires a valid handler
//! and initialized shared state. Generated priority setters take the encoded priority
//! (and optionally an already-held critical-section token). These external generators
//! retain their upstream item documentation.
//!
//! ## Feature flags
#![doc = document_features::document_features!(feature_label = r#"<span class="stab portability"><code>{feature}</code></span>"#)]

